## Studio allocation rollout

Studio bookings and renewals use the tenant's `studios` allocation, falling back
 to the catalog default. Archive continues to use the platform default.

Stage only the Studio allocation in the local release queue (safe to repeat):

```sh
node replay.mjs stage orchid-quota studio
