Publication replays all feed operations, then selects subscribed days for
`window.service` and `window.tenant` from `window.from` through `window.through`
(inclusive). It replaces those cells with the feed edition, capacity, used and
available units, preserving every other diary cell. Repeating publication is
idempotent. `preview-calendar` and `rebuild-calendar` retain full-feed behavior.

Run checks with `node --test visible.test.mjs regression.test.mjs`.
